          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ganita Prakash | Grade 7"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.089,
            0.581,
            0.111
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Is One Lakh a Very Large Number?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.12,
            0.655,
            0.156
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Eshwarappa asked Roxie and Estu, “Is a lakh big or small?”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.158,
            0.584,
            0.177
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Roxie feels that 1 lakh is a large number:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.181,
            0.656,
            0.218
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• “We had one lakh varieties of rice — that is a lot.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.66,
            0.085,
            0.894,
            0.234
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.66,
                0.085,
                0.894,
                0.234
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_3_image_5.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.224,
            0.656,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "“Living 1 lakh days would mean living for 274 years — that is a really long time!”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.266,
            0.847,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "“If 1 lakh people stood shoulder to shoulder in a line they could stretch as far as 38 kilometres.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.309,
            0.534,
            0.328
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Estu, however, thinks it is not that big:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.333,
            0.666,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "“Do you know that the cricket stadium in Ahmedabad has a seating capacity of more than 1 lakh? One lakh people in such a small area!”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.412,
            0.667,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "“Most humans have 80,000 to 1,20,000 hairs on their heads. Imagine, 1 lakh hairs fit in such a tiny space!”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.675,
            0.322,
            0.879,
            0.486
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.675,
                0.322,
                0.879,
                0.486
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_3_image_11.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.474,
            0.667,
            0.51
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "“I heard that there are some species of fish where a female fish can lay almost one lakh"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.51,
            0.847,
            0.547
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "eggs at once very comfortably. Some even lay tens of lakhs of eggs at a time.”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.557,
            0.635,
            0.579
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How do you view a lakh — is a lakh big or small?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.606,
            0.529,
            0.627
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reading and Writing Numbers"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.637,
            0.848,
            0.73
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We have already been using commas for 5-digit numbers like 45,830 in the Indian place value system. As numbers grow bigger, using commas helps in reading the numbers easily. We use a comma in between the digits representing the “ten thousands” place and the “one lakh” place as you have seen just before (1,00,000)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.729,
            0.846,
            0.766
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The number name of 12,78,830 is twelve lakh seventy eight thousand eight hundred thirty."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.766,
            0.846,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Similarly, the number 15,75,000 in words is fifteen lakh seventy five thousand."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.803,
            0.669,
            0.822
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Write each of the numbers given below in words:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.183,
            0.827,
            0.315,
            0.846
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) 3,00,600"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.183,
            0.851,
            0.315,
            0.87
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) 5,04,085"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.184,
            0.875,
            0.326,
            0.894
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) 27,30,000"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.185,
            0.899,
            0.326,
            0.918
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) 70,53,138"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.939,
            0.182,
            0.954
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4"
            }
          ]
        },
